<div class="hero"><img src="ui-icons/collection-options/stacked-layers.svg" alt="Stacked layers" width="112" height="112"></div><h2>Stacked layers</h2><p>A compact, orderly set.</p><div class="sizes"><div><img src="ui-icons/collection-options/stacked-layers.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20"><span>20px</span></div><div><img src="ui-icons/collection-options/stacked-layers.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24"><span>24px</span></div><div><img src="ui-icons/collection-options/stacked-layers.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30"><span>30px</span></div><div><img src="ui-icons/collection-options/stacked-layers.svg" alt="" width="48" height="48"><span>48px</span></div></div><div class="tree-example"><span>⌄</span><img src="ui-icons/collection-options/stacked-layers.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30"><span>Night Sky</span><small>2</small></div><a href="ui-icons/collection-options/stacked-layers.svg" download>Download SVG ↗</a></article><article><div class="number">03</div><div class="hero"><img src="ui-icons/collection-options/linked-nodes.svg" alt="Linked nodes" width="112" height="112"></div><h2>Linked nodes</h2><p>Connected references, not a container.</p><div class="sizes"><div><img src="ui-icons/collection-options/linked-nodes.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20"><span>20px</span></div><div><img src="ui-icons/collection-options/linked-nodes.svg" alt="" width="24" height="24"><span>24px</span></div><div><img src="ui-icons/collection-options/linked-nodes.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30"><span>30px</span></div><div><img src="ui-icons/collection-options/linked-nodes.svg" alt="" width="48" height="48"><span>48px</span></div></div><div class="tree-example"><span>⌄</span><img src="ui-icons/collection-options/linked-nodes.svg" alt="" width="30" height="30"><span>Night Sky</span><small>2</small></div><a href="ui-icons/collection-options/linked-nodes.svg" download>Download SVG ↗</a></article></section><footer>Preview only · choose 01, 02, 03 or 04 to use it in the editor.</footer></ma