acts. No chip pins, circuit traces or mounting details."}, {"id": "earth", "name": "World / Earth", "group": "Celestial", "description": "A shaded blue Earth with geographically projected, simplified continents, fine cloud bands and a restrained atmospheric rim."}, {"id": "editor-point-light", "name": "Point light", "group": "Editor", "description": "Compact colored point light symbol for editor controls. Flat native SVG with no gradients, glow, or raster assets."}, {"id": "editor-spotlight", "name": "Spotlight", "group": "Editor", "description": "Compact colored spotlight symbol for editor controls. Flat native SVG with no gradients, glow, or raster assets."}, {"id": "editor-area-light", "name": "Area light", "group": "Editor", "description": "Compact colored area light symbol for editor controls. Flat native SVG with no gradients, glow, or raster assets."}, {"id": "editor-select", "name": "Select", "group": "Editor", "description": "Compact colored select symbol for editor controls. Flat native SVG with no gradients, glow, or raster assets."}, {"id": "editor-move", "name": "Move", "group": "Editor", "description": "Compact colored move symbol for editor controls. Flat native SVG with no gradients, glow, or raster assets."}, {"id": "editor-rotate", "name": "Rotate", "group": "Editor", "description": "Compact colored rotate symbol for editor controls. Flat native SVG with no gradients, glow, or raster assets."}, {"id": "editor-scale", "name": "Scale", "group": "Editor", "description": "Compact colored scale symbol for editor controls. Flat native SVG with no gradients, glow, or raster assets."}, {"id": "editor-pivot", "name": "Pivot", "group": "Editor", "description": "Compact colored pivot symbol for editor controls. Flat native SVG with no gradients, glow, or raster assets."}, {"id": "editor-snap", "name": "Snap", "group": "Editor", "description": "Compact colored snap symbol for editor controls. Flat native SVG with no gradients, glow, or raster assets."}, {"id":